# No em dashes

Never use an em dash (`—`, U+2014) anywhere in this project: UI copy, metadata, comments, docs, or commit messages.

## Prefer instead

- A comma, colon, or full stop
- A spaced hyphen: ` - `
- A short rewrite that avoids the dash entirely

```text
❌ Every car is supplied with a fresh MOT — one less thing to think about.
✅ Every car is supplied with a fresh MOT - one less thing to think about.
✅ Every car is supplied with a fresh MOT: one less thing to think about.
```

If you find an existing em dash, replace it. Do not introduce new ones.
